Description: screenshot selection and annotation tool built with Qt 6
 Mark Shot captures screenshots, annotates image regions, pins floating image
 stickers, and provides OCR, code scanning, translation, scrolling capture, and
 screen recording integrations. It supports both Wayland and X11 desktops.
